      "text": "Figure 6: The values of ∆ p ( t ;1 / 2 , 2). The top curve corresponds to p = 8 implemented in double precision, the middle curve in gray color (the bottom curve) correspond to p = 8 and (respectively, p = 12) impemented in quadruple precision.",
